#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Cinema news" tvg-id="503142975" tvg-name="Emmanuel Mouret has crafted a unique cinematic voice‚ blending comedy‚ drama and emotion. His films follow strong-willed characters navigating love and heartache with tenderness. Through precise‚ sensory writing‚ Mouret explores the delicate balance between burlesque and genuine human vulnerability.<br/>From 01.05.2025 09:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",A Conversation with Emmanuel Mouret (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.05.2025)
