#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="816755663" tvg-name="In the Lens basin at the start of the 20th century‚ the film follows the hopes and hardships of a tight-knit mining community. With a socially conscious‚ realist eye‚ Louis Daquin portrays the daily grit of northern France’s coal workers and the rising tension between a young engineer and his entrenched superior.<br/>From 16.12.2025 11:39" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Mark of the Day (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (16.12.2025)
