#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="521092870" tvg-name="Cati grew up in a state orphanage in Budapest. When she finds out her mother is alive and living in a rural village‚ she sets out to find her. What she finds instead is a world of contradictions and a community of peculiar residents‚ caught between the contradictions of the city and the countryside‚ of freedom and repression.<br/>From 01.10.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Day Has Gone (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.10.2025)
