#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="260740931" tvg-name="In a working-class suburb of southern Spain‚ 16-year-old Tano gets a two-day break from juvenile detention to attend his brother’s wedding. Joined by his best friend‚ he plunges into a chaotic spree of parties‚ petty crime and fleeting pleasures.<br/>From 01.09.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",7 Virgins (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.09.2025)
