#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1058888953" tvg-name="In a crumbling Madrid apartment block‚ estate agent Julia discovers a hidden fortune in a deceased tenant’s flat. Tempted by dreams of escape and luxury‚ she soon learns she’s not the only one with eyes on the money. Álex de la Iglesia crafts a tense and dark comic thriller where greed‚ paranoia and neighbourly menace bubble just beneath the surface.<br/>From 01.09.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Common Wealth (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.09.2025)
