#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="363554358" tvg-name="Lisbon‚ 1918. Maria Adelaide Coelho da Cunha‚ heiress and owner of the prestigious Diário de Notícias‚ abandons her life of wealth and privilege to run away with a much younger chauffeur. Her scandalous decision shakes Portuguese high society and leads to devastating personal and moral consequences.<br/>From 01.10.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Moral Order (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.10.2025)
