#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="696351306" tvg-name="An English couple travels to Italy. After their arrival in Naples‚ cracks start to show in their relationship. This film is one of Roberto Rossellini's best works‚ which inspired a generation of French New Wave filmmakers. The couple is played by Ingrid Bergman‚ who made four other films with Rossellini‚ and George Sanders.<br/>From 01.11.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Journey to Italy (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.11.2025)
