#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1072045251" tvg-name="Stationed in a remote Bulgarian village in 1943‚ German sergeant Walter lives seemingly untouched by the war until a convoy of Greek Jews on its way to Auschwitz arrives. That is how he meets Ruth‚ a young Jewish woman whose courage awakens his conscience. As love grows between prisoner and guard‚ Walter faces a devastating choice between duty and humanity in the shadow of fascism.<br/>From 20.10.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Stars (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (20.10.2025)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/005000/005400/005406-000-B_SQ_0_VOA-STE%5BANG%5D_10470404_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-80943415493495_2h9wz16tepG.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1877282553" tvg-name="In a small Polish village‚ 15-year-old Eryk lives with his mother‚ grandmother and great-grandmother – three dominant women who shape his world. Bound to his mother by a suffocating bond‚ Eryk confuses love with control. When his obsession with a 13-year-old neighbour turns violent‚ the consequences expose the deep fractures and silent complicities within his family and community.<br/>From 13.11.2025 17:18" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Light as Feathers (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.11.2025)
