#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1054239458" tvg-name="Babette‚ a carefree dancer‚ reluctantly opens her small Paris apartment to Edo‚ a Congolese refugee and musician. Their uneasy coexistence is thrown into disarray when Mousey‚ an escaped lab mouse‚ comes into their lives. Between cultural clashes‚ fragile desires and shifting ideas of family – Babette and Edo must redefine what intimacy and responsibility mean.<br/>From 13.11.2025 17:07" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Maoussi (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.11.2025)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/128000/128200/128276-000-A_SQ_0_VOF-STE%5BANG%5D_10618047_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-80983858530041_2jUfL1EPzPp.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1372692119" tvg-name="Semret lives a modest and isolated life in Zurich with her teenage daughter Joe. She works at a hospital and is applying to a midwife training programme. When her daughter starts to ask about her roots in Eritrea‚ Semret can no longer keep her past a secret and is forced to confront the trauma she has lived through.<br/>From 01.11.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Semret (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.11.2025)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/116000/116600/116664-000-A_SQ_0_VO-STE%5BANG%5D_10509918_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-40461945300070_2hpcs17i034.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="420153644" tvg-name="In 1903 Tahiti‚ doctor‚ poet and artist Victor Segalen sails from France to Hiva-Oa‚ eager to meet Paul Gauguin. But upon reaching the island‚ he learns that the painter has just died. Inspired by Segalen’s own writings‚ “Off the Beaten Track” is a reflection on Gauguin’s legacy‚ his contradictions and the uneasy dynamics between colonisers and the colonised.<br/>From 18.11.2025 10:56" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Off the Beaten Track (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (18.11.2025)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/128000/128000/128009-000-A_SQ_0_VOF-STE%5BANG%5D_10615892_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-80983754499962_2jTEY1EPWfr.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1201201599" tvg-name="In 1496‚ Princess Joan of Castile enters a political marriage with Philip of Habsburg – but what begins as mutual passion soon unravels. As Joan becomes Queen of Spain‚ her devotion to Philip deepens into obsession. Surrounded by infidelity and court intrigue‚ her love is tested by forces more dangerous than desire.<br/>From 01.09.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Mad Love (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.09.2025)
