#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1196470886" tvg-name="Arthur and Diana‚ siblings with little in common besides their father’s old Renault‚ set out from Berlin with Diana’s toddler in tow to renew the car’s long-overdue inspection in Paris. What should be a simple road trip turns into a chain of detours‚ including police stops‚ family tensions‚ parties and flat tires – leading them far from their planned route.<br/>From 13.11.2025 17:24" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Arthur & Diana (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.11.2025)
