#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1673291792" tvg-name="Sunny‚ a pop singer touring small East German towns with a mediocre band‚ feels increasingly trapped by routine and loneliness. When she begins an affair with Ralph‚ a saxophonist and philosopher obsessed with death‚ she hopes for change but finds no escape. After being expelled from the band‚ Sunny must face herself and her desire for a life beyond conformity in a society that leaves little room .....<br/>From 20.10.2025 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Solo Sunny (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (20.10.2025)
