#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1790079411" tvg-name="Over the course of a single day‚ actor and director Jacques Nolot speaks candidly about his desires‚ anxieties and the fleeting moments that give life meaning – all while alluding to death. As his words unfold‚ the border between memory and dream begins to blur‚ creating a fragile‚ intimate portrait of a man confronting the passage of time.<br/>From 13.11.2025 17:34" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",I Have Already Died Three Times (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.11.2025)
