#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="2112965862" tvg-name="In the early 1950s‚ as the Iron Curtain cuts Germany in two‚ a young factory worker from the East named Anna secretly crosses the border to reclaim her son‚ who lives with his grandparents in the West. Along the way she meets Carl‚ a border policeman who helps her. As love grows between them‚ so does the political divide that makes their union impossible.<br/>From 22.10.2025 15:55" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Sky Without Stars (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (22.10.2025)
