#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="855633536" tvg-name="On a sweltering summer day‚ Draginja finds a corpse identical to herself. In another life‚ she hires a fake husband to impress her friends. One winter night‚ she wanders the streets‚ chasing fragments of a lost memory. Through these three possible lives‚ a middle-aged woman drifts between reality and illusion‚ struggling to step outside her own skin.<br/>From 13.11.2025 16:39" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Have You Seen This Woman? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.11.2025)
