#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="831488814" tvg-name="Often referred to in France as “Berbers”‚ meaning barbarians‚ the Amazigh are an indigenous people from the North African littoral. At a time where this culture is at risk of fading‚ a new generation of Amazigh are reclaiming their heritage through their art – with a modern twist. From cyber chaabi to tattoos‚ meet the women who are revitalising their Amazigh heritage. <br/>From 17.06.2024 17:36" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks - Don’t Call Them Berbers (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.06.2024)
