#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1788263831" tvg-name="Icelandic winters are brutal‚ with life conducted in almost permanent darkness for months on end. Bernard Fontanille‚ French emergency doctor‚ meets Erla Bjornsdottir‚ a sleep specialist‚ to find out how lack of sunlight is impacting the health and well-being of the population. He meets a SAD sufferer with an unusual coping technique.<br/>From 11.03.2016 16:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World: Iceland - At the Heart of the Arctic Night (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (11.03.2016)
