#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1523216347" tvg-name="The ancestral territory of the Navajo‚ nestled in the canyons of Arizona‚ is the largest Indian tribe in the United States. Traditionally‚ the health and balance of the world‚ and that of men‚ is intertwined. Bernard Fontanille‚ a French emergency doctor‚ meets with Albert Lauhter‚ who cares for the elderly with the help of ancient songs.<br/>From 16.03.2016 15:52" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World: USA - Arizona‚ and the Nation of Medicine Men (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (16.03.2016)
