#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="445231081" tvg-name="Madagascar is a paradise that is home to an ecosystem full of pharmacological treasures. In a country shaped by ancestor worship‚ medicine and treatment is a complex interaction between spirits and botanicals. Bernard Fontanille‚ emergency doctor from France‚ meets a traditional healer in the village of Anantsono. With the help of the spirits‚ she invokes trances and uses the treasures of nature t.....<br/>From 24.02.2016 15:45" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - Madagascar (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (24.02.2016)
