#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1510200640" tvg-name="In the Philippines‚ traditional massage therapists known as 'manghihilot' have only their hands and coconut oil to heal their patients. Bernard Fontanille meets Angelita Calderon‚ a woman who treats the villagers and farmers through manipulation of muscle and control of pressure points.<br/>From 07.03.2016 16:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World: The Philippines - The Massages of the Hillot (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (07.03.2016)
