#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="878942308" tvg-name="Isolated in the Indian Ocean‚ Reunion's population is multi-ethnic‚ with influences from Madagascar‚ East Africa‚ Europe‚ India and China. Bernard Fontanille meets the herbal tea makers who use Creole medicine to help their patients.<br/>From 26.02.2016 17:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - Creole Herbal Teas on Reunion Island (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (26.02.2016)
