#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1136876532" tvg-name="The Russian Republic of Tuva‚ in the far south of Siberia‚ is the origin of Shamanism. 22 year old Buyan is both heir to ancient tradition and follower of a modern approach.<br/>From 10.03.2016 16:18" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - Russia‚ Cradle of Shamanism (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (10.03.2016)
