#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="718977569" tvg-name="In Colombia‚ on the Amazonian planes of Mocoa‚ Bernard Fontanille discovers the traditional uses for ayahuasca‚ known in the region as yagé. This plant is used to brew a psychedelic concoction sacred to the indigenous communities. 72 different tribes in the Amazon use it. It it has become subject to a new type of tourism that can be dangerous.<br/>From 14.03.2016 15:45" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World: Colombia - Sacred Plant of the Amazon (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (14.03.2016)
