#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="648832481" tvg-name="Romanians are followers of apitherapy‚ medicine derived from bee products. Emergency physician Bernard Fontanille goes to visit Dr. Eugen Stefan. A mainstream doctor‚ he is also a passionate beekeeper‚ and treats his patients with bee venom. In search of traditional medicines‚ Bernard goes to the heart of the Carpathians.<br/>From 23.02.2016 15:52" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - The Miracle of Bees (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.02.2016)
