#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1742395330" tvg-name="In the ancestral land of the Mapuche‚ who are the largest indigenous minority in Chile‚ Bernard Fontanille meets Rosa Barbosa‚ a traditional healer who draws on the power of the earth‚ the sea and the mountains.<br/>From 09.03.2016 15:59" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - The Mapuche Healers of Chile (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.03.2016)
