#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1993075894" tvg-name="The Zapotecs are one of the largest and ancient indigenous peoples of Mexico. Today‚ in these valleys surrounded by agave fields‚ they maintain a traditional community-centered life. Bernard Fontanille meets Paulina‚ a traditional midwife and healer. She provides both physical and psychological healing to her patients.<br/>From 04.03.2016 15:52" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - Mexico and the Zapotec People (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (04.03.2016)
