#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="111583336" tvg-name="Haida Gwaii is a magical place. With its ancient forests and its wild beaches‚ this archipelago in the North Pacific‚ off the coast of British Columbia‚ is testament to the forces of nature. Bernard Fontanille discovers the traditional healing culture of the island‚ which colonialism almost eradicated.<br/>From 17.03.2016 16:34" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World: Canada - Haida Gwaii‚ Earth of the People (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.03.2016)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/053000/053900/053966-008-A_SQ_0_VOF-STE%5BANG%5D_10574711_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-100922384566606_2ipFl1DfECb.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="454122480" tvg-name="In Myanmar‚ the practice of Buddhism is mixed with occult beliefs deeply rooted in Burmese culture. Masters of the Higher Way treat their patients using mystical tattoos and a rich and complex spirituality. In Bago‚ Bernard Fontanille accompanies Aung Myo Hein to a monastery‚ where Aung Myo Hein regularly provides care.<br/>From 02.03.2016 15:51" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - Myanmar and Mystical Tattoos (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.03.2016)
