#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="2140443649" tvg-name="From the USSR to war-torn present-day Ukraine‚ this is the incredible story of an entertainer who became president and a figure who embodies resistance to Russian aggression for his country and the world. This two-part documentary finds out who Volodymyr Zelensky really is‚ featuring rare archive footage and interviews with President Zelensky himself‚ and those closest to him.<br/>From 13.05.2025 20:15" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",How Volodymyr Became Zelensky (1/2) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.05.2025)
