#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="529594565" tvg-name="The incredible story of a popular entertainer who became president of Ukraine. Second part: Volodymyr Zelensky was working in Moscow when back in Ukraine the Maïdan revolution broke out at the end of 2013: Thousands of Ukrainians were on the streets of Kyiv in pro-European demonstrations.<br/>From 13.05.2025 21:15" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",How Volodymr Became Zelensky (2/2) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.05.2025)
