#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="2124740598" tvg-name="In the months leading up to the military coup in Chile‚ supporters of the socialist president Allende try to create a ' state within a state ' with political and charitable actions - as a counterweight to the anti-reform forces in the country‚ supported by the Nixon administration in the USA.<br/>From 12.09.2023 12:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Battle of Chile (3/3) - People Power (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (12.09.2023)
