#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="1030529822" tvg-name="On a map‚ the village of Nahwa looks like a fried egg: An Emirati enclave in the Omani territory of Mahda‚ itself landlocked in the United Arab Emirates. The reason for this? The choice of local people decades ago at a time when water was more precious than oil.<br/>From 25.09.2024 15:42" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Crazy Borders - Nahwa and Madha: An Enclave within an Enclave (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (25.09.2024)
