#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="894633075" tvg-name="120 years ago‚ a capitalist Eldorado emerged in the USA‚ paving the way for today’s billionaires such as Elon Musk‚ Jeff Bezos and Bill Gates. How did the power of the super-rich consolidate‚ especially during the depression after 1929 or during Ronald Reagan's policy of deregulation and tax cuts in the 1980s?<br/>From 25.02.2025 18:40" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Capitalism in America - The Cult of Wealth (1/3) - A Paradise for Millionaires (1870-1920) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (25.02.2025)
