#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="1471641572" tvg-name="Did you know that the last war between France and Spain took place in the 1970s? It was the war of the stop signs in Llívia‚ a Spanish town - but in France‚ in the Pyrenees. This bizarre quirk is due to a treaty signed centuries ago. This really is a case for Crazy Borders! <br/>From 13.07.2022 10:19" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Crazy Borders - Llivia‚ Between France and Spain (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.07.2022)
