#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="734816719" tvg-name="A history of American capitalism. Episode 2: Appointed Secretary of the Treasury in 1921‚ aluminium magnate Andrew Mellon developed the 'trickle-down' theory. But the millionaires' paradise collided with the economic crash of 1929‚ which plunged the USA into the Great Depression and mass unemployment. Could Roosevelt save America from dire economic straits?<br/>From 25.02.2025 18:40" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Capitalism in America - The Cult of Wealth (2/3) - Making the rich pay (1921-1946) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (25.02.2025)
