#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - Civilisations" tvg-id="1079358481" tvg-name="Penelope is now forced to choose a husband among the suitors. She offers them a test to decide who among them is the most worthy: with the bow of Odysseus‚ they must shoot an arrow and pass it through twelve axe heads. But none succeed‚ until the beggar tries his luck. He is successful‚ and reveals his true face: he is Odysseus‚ the legitimate king of Ithaca.<br/>From 11.09.2025 17:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Great Myths - The Odyssey (10/10) - Twilight of the Gods (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (11.09.2025)
