#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Investigation and reports" tvg-id="1099116942" tvg-name="In the centre of São Paulo‚ the largest city in the Southern Hemisphere‚ a whole area is completely taken over by the drug trade. Locals call it Cracolandia (Crackland)‚ a city district where thousands of homeless and addicts live. But in this desperate place‚ a clown is trying to help the most vulnerable.<br/>From 08.08.2025 17:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",ARTE Reportage - Brazil: The Clown of Cracolandia (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (08.08.2025)
