#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Switching viewpoints" tvg-id="534966995" tvg-name="In Yangambi‚ Congo‚ the remains of a research centre for tropical agriculture bear witness to the colonial past. The documentary highlights the connection between colonisation and the climate crisis and in doing so‚ adopts an unusual perspective: that of the tree of authenticity‚ which plays a decisive role in climate regulation.<br/>From 23.10.2025 16:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Tree of Authenticity (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.10.2025)
