#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Switching viewpoints" tvg-id="1678598449" tvg-name="France has a long history of protest culture which is famous throughout the world. But does protest work? Jagoda Marinic visits south-west France where angry environmental and farmer disputes show a country ill at ease. <br/>From 30.05.2024 13:40" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Nice to Meet You: France - Europe with Jagoda Marinic (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.05.2024)
