#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Switching viewpoints" tvg-id="1275894956" tvg-name="Since the end of the armed conflict between the Colombian state and FARC‚ the natural beauty of the Cano Cristales‚ a Colombian river also known as the River of Five Colours‚ is under threat from tourism and private sector exploitation. Guillermo Quintero's film shows the paradox of peace‚ which has brought new problems to a remote region of the Amazon.<br/>From 01.12.2025 23:25" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Red River (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.12.2025)
