#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Switching viewpoints" tvg-id="389082270" tvg-name="Artificial Intelligence is in the news every day. We hear how it is misleading us with deep fakes‚ will replace us in the workplace‚ or even wipe out the human race. For British artist and researcher James Bridle‚ while the advances and risks are usually exaggerated‚ our obsession with AI could allow us to recognise the many forms of non-human intelligence.<br/>From 02.12.2024 17:34" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",What is Intelligence? - Open Ideas with James Bridle (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.12.2024)
