#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Switching viewpoints" tvg-id="1084128447" tvg-name="Viennese humour is special. Often dark and biting‚ it nevertheless allows Austrians to tell certain truths in a light-hearted way. Is this just what Europe needs? Jagoda Marinić meets members of the Viennese culture scene and questions the limits of Austrian humour.<br/>From 09.07.2024 14:28" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Nice to meet you: Austria - Europe with Jagoda Marinic (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.07.2024)
