#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Switching viewpoints" tvg-id="631806846" tvg-name="What effects does pride have on a sense of community? In Poland‚ Jagoda Marinić observes pride in many forms: Women are proud to fight abortion laws. National pride is expressed in the desire to uphold the memory of fallen soldiers. And LGBTQIA+ communities see pride in the fight for their rights.<br/>From 01.07.2024 09:55" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Nice to Meet You: Poland - Europe with Jagoda Marinic (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.07.2024)
