#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Environment" tvg-id="1444241397" tvg-name="Off the coast of Corsica‚ at a depth of one hundred metres‚ strange circular forms were picked up by an oceanographic survey in 2011. What are these mysterious rings? How were they formed? And could they be a living organism? A team of scientists led by celebrated diver and biologist Laurent Ballesta‚ tried to answer these questions.<br/>From 18.06.2025 09:46" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Cap Corse - The Mystery of the Rings (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (18.06.2025)
