#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Environment" tvg-id="54193644" tvg-name="To survive in the extreme environment of the desert‚ Corentin and Caroline will need a shelter to protect them from the blazing sun and house their various low-tech technology and food sources. They enlist the help of specialist engineers to design a bespoke cocoon using only biomaterials<br/>From 23.04.2024 14:17" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Biosphere Experiment - Making of - Living with Biomaterials (5/5) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.04.2024)
