#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Environment" tvg-id="104197271" tvg-name="Making chocolate for one euro‚ eco-friendly jeans at rock-bottom prices‚ fair-trade‚ organic‚ and cheap coffee - discounters and fashion chains are suddenly offering customers the opportunity to save the world. Is it all just greenwashing and deception?<br/>From 08.06.2023 17:12" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Agree to Disagree! - The Privilege of Sustainable Shopping (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (08.06.2023)
