#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Technology and innovation" tvg-id="1602366518" tvg-name="If you spin a top‚ it will continue to rotate on its own for a while. Physicists found the explanation for this phenomenon: inside angular momentum. In sport it is used by trampoliners. They are true masters of the art of turning and can perform up to 50 spins in 20 seconds.<br/>From 30.07.2021 12:55" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Trampoline and Kinetic Energy - The Mechanics of Strength (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.07.2021)
